<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to issue HUF 15 bln of 12-mo T-bills.</title>
<headline>Hungary to issue HUF 15 bln of 12-mo T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will issue twelve-month treasury bills of a maximum 15 billion forints between April 7 and 18, the State Debt Management Agency (AKK) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p> Series				    1998/IV</p>
<p> Subscription starting date	  April 7, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date			   April 23, 1998</p>
<p> Subscription period		   April 7 to 18, 1997</p>
<p> Subscription price		    between April 7 and 15</p>
<p>							   99.70 percent</p>
<p>					     between April 16 and 18</p>
<p>							  100.00 percent</p>
<p> Minimum amount on offer	     HUF 1 billion</p>
<p> Maximum amount on offer	     HUF 15 billion</p>
<p> Interest				  annual 19 percent</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
